  {
    "id": "ability-lifecycle-002",
    "categoryId": "ability-lifecycle",
    "type": "single",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "title": "在 UIAbility 中拿到 WindowStage 并加载页面内容，最应该从哪个回调开始处理？",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "onWindowStageCreate(windowStage)"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "onCreate(want, launchParam)"
      },
      {
        "id": "c",
        "text": "onBackground()"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "onDestroy()"
      }
    ],
    "correctOptionIds": [
      "a"
    ],
    "explanation": "UIAbility.onWindowStageCreate(windowStage) 在该 UIAbility 的 WindowStage 创建时触发，并直接提供 windowStage 参数。页面加载和窗口相关初始化应从这里处理，而不是在尚未获得 WindowStage 的 onCreate 中硬取窗口。",
    "knowledgePoints": [
      "UIAbility",
